# Force LF on checkout everywhere (Prettier enforces LF; Windows runners
# default to autocrlf=true and would otherwise flag every file).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
# Audio (#174, #173). Auto-detection already spares them — every one of these
# carries NUL bytes — but the art formats above are declared rather than left
# to it, and a file the panel plays deserves the same certainty.
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
